    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78962" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρα-τροπέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρατρέπω, τί με ταῦτα
					παρατροπέων ἀγορεύεις</span>
